      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a 14 hour shift. honestly i don't even know why i bother showing up anymore. it feels like i'm just trying to bail out the ocean with a spoon. every time we stabilize someone, three more people come through those doors in the same state. it is just... endless. feels like a losing game.",
